WEBVTT

00:10:59.939 --> 00:11:02.546
because we can stream Netflix
anywhere we want.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:05.480
But if you think about the developing
countries of the world,

00:11:05.504 --> 00:11:08.320
you've just disseminated
the entire knowledge of the world

00:11:08.344 --> 00:11:10.346
to every single person in the world.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.396
And that's going to have
a pretty major effect.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:14.571
Thanks very much.

00:11:14.595 --> 00:11:19.253
(Applause)